          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/64e32a7c5fb64d3aa2125b01fe09dc24_l03b04-los-sabados-iba-a-un-curso-de-dibujo.mp3?Expires=1794099526&Signature=ddV-OX71yUen3c-OLpo5kyI84IjEeE51V8FAqCL8QuCgLNNtXoRqtnWouxYjYYUB2f9CyqgobVcckrCl0fcFYb0Wk6YHOmWyqa1RQah0ICMRqLncFYMgM0XBbqeGD8cXRMU-S2PmARaWZoUczeBPwIdh4wOtGHivrgIyIece0MPGf6IFWRghY6oPdvQLS~0X827hGHsNHmbntlv6TIUcxCD-Bef50aAUaRDUbk8pmb5lezFpYVZjdn6ndd4rd10NJAJoKmMy7~AgeAgLLf3OVUq3mklyrFLJuX3XfArnbJeEAxsvulNP-6UBE9t8Ksylc4rjqWDBmHKNwdthWQ6mJg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
